{"number":96,"nameArabic":"العلق","nameTransliterated":"Al-'Alaq","nameTranslated":"The Clot","revelationPlace":"makkah","versesCount":19,"verses":[{"ayah":1,"verseKey":"96:1","textAr":"ٱقۡرَأۡ بِٱسۡمِ رَبِّكَ ٱلَّذِي خَلَقَ","transliteration":"Iqra biismi rabbika allathee khalaqa","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Recite in the name of your Lord who created"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"پڑھو (اے نبیؐ) اپنے رب کے نام کے ساتھ جس نے پیدا کیا"}]},{"ayah":2,"verseKey":"96:2","textAr":"خَلَقَ ٱلۡإِنسَٰنَ مِنۡ عَلَقٍ","transliteration":"Khalaqa alinsana min AAalaqin","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Created man from a clinging substance"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"جمے ہوئے خون کے ایک لوتھڑے سے انسان کی تخلیق کی"}]},{"ayah":3,"verseKey":"96:3","textAr":"ٱقۡرَأۡ وَرَبُّكَ ٱلۡأَكۡرَمُ","transliteration":"Iqra warabbuka alakramu","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Recite, and your Lord is the most Generous"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"پڑھو، اور تمہارا رب بڑا کریم ہے"}]},{"ayah":4,"verseKey":"96:4","textAr":"ٱلَّذِي عَلَّمَ بِٱلۡقَلَمِ","transliteration":"Allathee AAallama bialqalami","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Who taught by the pen"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"جس نے قلم کے ذریعہ سے علم سکھایا"}]},{"ayah":5,"verseKey":"96:5","textAr":"عَلَّمَ ٱلۡإِنسَٰنَ مَا لَمۡ يَعۡلَمۡ","transliteration":"AAallama alinsana ma lam yaAAlam","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Taught man that which he knew not"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"انسان کو وہ علم دیا جسے وہ نہ جانتا تھا"}]},{"ayah":6,"verseKey":"96:6","textAr":"كَلَّآ إِنَّ ٱلۡإِنسَٰنَ لَيَطۡغَىٰٓ","transliteration":"Kalla inna alinsana layatgha","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"No! [But] indeed, man transgresses"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"ہرگز نہیں، انسان سرکشی کرتا ہے"}]},{"ayah":7,"verseKey":"96:7","textAr":"أَن رَّءَاهُ ٱسۡتَغۡنَىٰٓ","transliteration":"An raahu istaghna","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Because he sees himself self-sufficient"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اِس بنا پر کہ وہ اپنے آپ کو بے نیاز دیکھتا ہے"}]},{"ayah":8,"verseKey":"96:8","textAr":"إِنَّ إِلَىٰ رَبِّكَ ٱلرُّجۡعَىٰٓ","transliteration":"Inna ila rabbika alrrujAAa","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Indeed, to your Lord is the return"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"پلٹنا یقیناً تیرے رب ہی کی طرف ہے"}]},{"ayah":9,"verseKey":"96:9","textAr":"أَرَءَيۡتَ ٱلَّذِي يَنۡهَىٰ","transliteration":"Araayta allathee yanha","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Have you seen the one who forbids"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"تم نے دیکھا اُس شخص کو"}]},{"ayah":10,"verseKey":"96:10","textAr":"عَبۡدًا إِذَا صَلَّىٰٓ","transliteration":"AAabdan itha salla","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"A servant when he prays"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"جو ایک بندے کو منع کرتا ہے جبکہ وہ نماز پڑھتا ہو؟"}]},{"ayah":11,"verseKey":"96:11","textAr":"أَرَءَيۡتَ إِن كَانَ عَلَى ٱلۡهُدَىٰٓ","transliteration":"Araayta in kana AAala alhuda","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Have you seen if he is upon guidance"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"تمہارا کیا خیال ہے اگر (وہ بندہ) راہ راست پر ہو"}]},{"ayah":12,"verseKey":"96:12","textAr":"أَوۡ أَمَرَ بِٱلتَّقۡوَىٰٓ","transliteration":"Aw amara bialttaqwa","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Or enjoins righteousness"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"یا پرہیزگاری کی تلقین کرتا ہو؟"}]},{"ayah":13,"verseKey":"96:13","textAr":"أَرَءَيۡتَ إِن كَذَّبَ وَتَوَلَّىٰٓ","transliteration":"Araayta in kaththaba watawalla","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Have you seen if he denies and turns away"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"تمہارا کیا خیال ہے اگر (یہ منع کرنے والا شخص حق کو) جھٹلاتا اور منہ موڑتا ہو؟"}]},{"ayah":14,"verseKey":"96:14","textAr":"أَلَمۡ يَعۡلَم بِأَنَّ ٱللَّهَ يَرَىٰ","transliteration":"Alam yaAAlam bianna Allaha yara","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Does he not know that Allah sees"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"کیا وہ نہیں جانتا کہ اللہ دیکھ رہا ہے؟"}]},{"ayah":15,"verseKey":"96:15","textAr":"كَلَّا لَئِن لَّمۡ يَنتَهِ لَنَسۡفَعَۢا بِٱلنَّاصِيَةِ","transliteration":"Kalla lain lam yantahi lanasfaAAan bialnnasiyati","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"No! If he does not desist, We will surely drag him by the forelock"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"ہرگز نہیں، اگر وہ باز نہ آیا تو ہم اس کی پیشانی کے بال پکڑ کر اسے کھینچیں گے"}]},{"ayah":16,"verseKey":"96:16","textAr":"نَاصِيَةٖ كَٰذِبَةٍ خَاطِئَةٖ","transliteration":"Nasiyatin kathibatin khatiatin","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"A lying, sinning forelock"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اُس پیشانی کو جو جھوٹی اور سخت خطا کار ہے"}]},{"ayah":17,"verseKey":"96:17","textAr":"فَلۡيَدۡعُ نَادِيَهُۥ","transliteration":"FalyadAAu nadiyahu","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Then let him call his associates"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"وہ بلا لے اپنے حامیوں کی ٹولی کو"}]},{"ayah":18,"verseKey":"96:18","textAr":"سَنَدۡعُ ٱلزَّبَانِيَةَ","transliteration":"SanadAAu alzzabaniyata","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"We will call the angels of Hell"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"ہم بھی عذاب کے فرشتوں کو بلا لیں گے"}]},{"ayah":19,"verseKey":"96:19","textAr":"كَلَّا لَا تُطِعۡهُ وَٱسۡجُدۡۤ وَٱقۡتَرِب۩","transliteration":"Kalla la tutiAAhu waosjud waiqtarib","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"No! Do not obey him. But prostrate and draw near [to Allah]"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"ہرگز نہیں، اُس کی بات نہ مانو اور سجدہ کرو اور (اپنے رب کا) قرب حاصل کرو"}]}]}